Runtime tools in the Windows portable ZIP
-----------------------------------------
The portable ZIP ships these programs unmodified in its tools folder. Their
license and copyright files are copied into the ZIP's third-party folder, and
exact versions and SHA-256 checksums are listed in runtime-sources.json.

  mpv       https://mpv.io                        (shinchiro/mpv-winbuild-cmake build)
  FFmpeg    https://ffmpeg.org                    (GyanD/codexffmpeg essentials build)
  ffprobe   https://ffmpeg.org                    (same FFmpeg build)
  yt-dlp    https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
  Deno      https://deno.com

Pinned download URLs are defined in scripts/package-windows.py.

